WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
Here are some things you probably didn't know you can do with instant ramen. 

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:04.210
But if you don't have time for that here are some simple things you can add to your ramen.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:04.710
Egg

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:05.210
Butter

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:05.650
American cheese

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:06.650
Chicken nuggets and BBQ sauce.

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.660
Peanut butter! Don't judge me it's kinda like pad thai. 

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:09.390
Ranch dressing

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:09.800
On a salad

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:10.660
In chex mix

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:11.810
Or even just plain. 

